ue novelist Alan Wake in the  long-awaited sequel to the psychological  third person horror game remedy's last  game control featured a crossover with  Alan Wake in its DLC creating a  connection between the two worlds that  many of us fans were excited to explore  further plus we'll get a chance to  explore the tortured inner workings of  Alan Wake himself  System Shock System Shock was a major  inspiration for numerous games in the  genre including later hits like Bioshock  and after a successful Kickstarter  campaign night dive Studios is ready to  bring it back with what originally began  as a remaster that has now morphed into  a full on reboot sadly night dive has  run into development troubles related to  the pandemic and other factors but the  game is set to be coming in 2023 and we  are excited to see what they come up  with  Amnesia the bunker the horror game  series that may not have created but  certainly how popularized the  disempowered unable to fight back  against the monster's genre of horror  for a generation of YouTube creators and  Watchers is back with a new first person  horror game set in a World War One  bunker like the rest of the games in the  series The Bunker looks to be a tense  experience as you work to find a way out  while trying to escape threats the game  also features a semi-open world  randomized elements a new crafting  system and even the ability to defend  yourself this time I'm sure it'll be a  ton of help and I won't spend half my  time running around screaming like  little babies  foreign  the follow-up to the critically  acclaimed oxenfree is coming this year  and this time you play as Riley who  returns to her hometown to investigate a  mysterious radio signal but finds that  there may be more going on than meets  the eye while it's not I perfectly snug  fit in the horror genre oxen free 2  certainly brings with it an eerie  atmosphere that is definitely unsettling  at the very least it's going to continue  the original ga